## Documentation Files

Documentation is immutable after it is frozen.

Cursor must preserve:

- Section order.
- Naming.
- IDs.
- References.
- Cross-links.

Only formatting changes are allowed without approval.

---

## Workbook Files

Cursor must preserve:

- Worksheet names.
- Table names.
- Named ranges.
- Stable IDs.
- Worksheet responsibilities.
- Lookup table ownership.
- Validation integrity.
- Sheet protection.

Never generate duplicate IDs.

Never reorder ID columns.

---

## Excel Compatibility Rules

FinanceOS Version 1 is built entirely inside Microsoft Excel.

Cursor must ensure compatibility with:

- Excel Desktop (Windows)
- Excel Desktop (Mac)
- Excel Web
- Excel Android
- Excel iPhone / iPad

### Forbidden Features

Never use:

- VBA
- Office Scripts
- Power Query
- Power Pivot
- Macros
- COM Add-ins
- External APIs
- Desktop-only functions

Unless explicitly approved for a future version.

### Preferred Excel Features

Use:

- Excel Tables
- Named Ranges
- Data Validation
- Conditional Formatting
- Structured Table References
- XLOOKUP
- LET
- IFERROR
- FILTER (only where mobile compatible)
- Dynamic Arrays only when compatibility is confirmed.

---

